        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Time Flies, you’re a fly - your life is short and your bucket list is long! Learn an instrument, read a book, become rich, get drunk, or make someone smile. And if you don’t feel like pursuing your goals, you can just relax, clean your wings, and listen to music. Make the best of the time you have left, because we’re all going to die. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a painstakingly hand-drawn, densely detailed world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique and obscure goals to accomplish </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous intriguing ways to die </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimly variable life expectancy based on player location </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delightfully accurate fly physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most expansive game yet from the mind behind KIDS and Plug &amp; Play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/729811d283adec88d69171495de6c0e7.poster.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/729811d283adec88d69171495de6c0e7.webm?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/729811d283adec88d69171495de6c0e7.mp4?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/de95b201f4cf1bffe876c21fecedc27a.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/82545efca3922c43756c98d571661b62.poster.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/82545efca3922c43756c98d571661b62.webm?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/82545efca3922c43756c98d571661b62.mp4?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/e2b1faaa87a396dca78c78ff5b8089d1.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/2edd8689c009fb1e630360648d713cbf.poster.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/2edd8689c009fb1e630360648d713cbf.webm?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/2edd8689c009fb1e630360648d713cbf.mp4?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/06ba186a23504c68c04cf2e0ae60ed52.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Time Flies, you’re a fly - your life is short and your bucket list is long! Learn an instrument, read a book, become rich, get drunk, or make someone smile. And if you don’t feel like pursuing your goals, you can just relax, clean your wings, and listen to music. Make the best of the time you have left, because we’re all going to die. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a painstakingly hand-drawn, densely detailed world </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of unique and obscure goals to accomplish </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Numerous intriguing ways to die </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grimly variable life expectancy based on player location </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delightfully accurate fly physics </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The most expansive game yet from the mind behind KIDS and Plug &amp; Play</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/729811d283adec88d69171495de6c0e7.poster.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/729811d283adec88d69171495de6c0e7.webm?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/729811d283adec88d69171495de6c0e7.mp4?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/de95b201f4cf1bffe876c21fecedc27a.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/82545efca3922c43756c98d571661b62.poster.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/82545efca3922c43756c98d571661b62.webm?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/82545efca3922c43756c98d571661b62.mp4?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/e2b1faaa87a396dca78c78ff5b8089d1.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/2edd8689c009fb1e630360648d713cbf.poster.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/2edd8689c009fb1e630360648d713cbf.webm?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/2edd8689c009fb1e630360648d713cbf.mp4?t=1780910564\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2000120/extras/06ba186a23504c68c04cf2e0ae60ed52.avif?t=1780910564\" width=616 height=40 /></span></p>",
